  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d utarb ungdomslag</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to youth law</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttning av tidigare st&#xf6;d till utarbetandet av en integrerad ungdomspolitik. I den nu avslutande fasen ing&#xe5;r bl a att utarbeta ett lagf&#xf6;rslag baserat p&#xe5; projektets hittills vunna erfarenheter liksom fr&#xe5;n expertis i regionen. Utf&#xf6;rare &#xe4;r parlamentsutskottet f&#xf6;r ungdomsfr&#xe5;gor</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a continuation of a previous support to the elaboration of a integrated youth policy. The remaining phase consistsof elaborating a law proposal based on the experiences so far as well as regional experiences. The project is run by the Parliamentary commission of youth affairs.</narrative>
  </description>
